      "sourceFileHash": "05641b72a671a3ffb7514002ca72069e162bd49b895ce259518be7d07d723ae0",
      "originalText": "多くを語らず、ただ担当になってくれと聞けばよかった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "1345b1434bd6c9f79025b3b7a157f0f8",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/111900-Dream-Journey/rec-119.kojo",
